+# Public polish
+- Fixed the public frame’s desktop shrink-wrap so About, Educators, Cordas, and Graduation use the intended 1100 px canvas with aligned three- or four-column cards.
+- Tightened the home promise around Batizado readiness and added the missing skip-link targets on public entry pages.
+- Reworked the footer into clear Explore, ACE, Graduation, and Account groups with a stronger contact hierarchy and 44 px mobile targets.
+- Refined stop-card lift/shadow states, FAQ disclosure cues, mobile image rhythm, media captions, and the Batizado gate’s display type and pressed state.
+- Fixed More-menu keyboard traversal so hidden controls are skipped, desktop Tab exits cleanly to Log in, and the mobile sheet keeps focus contained.
+- Added stable, announced busy/success states to Contact and Shop without changing their routes or submission data.
+- Left the existing ACE-review flags, educator bio placeholders, uniform price, and Batizado 2026 date TBC for Camren/client confirmation; no dependencies were added.
+- Verified build, 20 tests, `SMOKE OK`, zero 390 px overflow/undersized targets/page errors, and saved both-width captures in `screenshots/polish/public/`.
